        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD to move, Space to dash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>Survivors-like</i> action game, you’re not the hero — <strong>you’re the boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life as waves of little heroes try to take you down. Collect <strong>gold</strong>, equip <strong>weapons</strong>, and grab <strong>power-ups</strong> to become an unstoppable force. Got duplicates? <strong>Combine two like weapons</strong> to craft even more powerful versions and discover synergies that fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the immersive music and satisfying sounds as you battle through growing hordes. This is an <strong>early playtest</strong> — and for now, all playable characters are <strong>unlocked</strong>, so you can experiment with a variety of builds and find your favorites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a limited number of waves right now, encouraging shorter sessions and more build variety. As we continue developing alongside our community, <strong>we’d love your feedback</strong>! Let us know what you like, what you don’t, and what you want to see added next.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD to move, Space to dash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <i>Survivors-like</i> action game, you’re not the hero — <strong>you’re the boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run for your life as waves of little heroes try to take you down. Collect <strong>gold</strong>, equip <strong>weapons</strong>, and grab <strong>power-ups</strong> to become an unstoppable force. Got duplicates? <strong>Combine two like weapons</strong> to craft even more powerful versions and discover synergies that fuel your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the immersive music and satisfying sounds as you battle through growing hordes. This is an <strong>early playtest</strong> — and for now, all playable characters are <strong>unlocked</strong>, so you can experiment with a variety of builds and find your favorites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a limited number of waves right now, encouraging shorter sessions and more build variety. As we continue developing alongside our community, <strong>we’d love your feedback</strong>! Let us know what you like, what you don’t, and what you want to see added next.</p>",
